# Sources of the BML study (study/r1/bml.md). The 2000 thesis text is 2.3.1; the axioms file is 2.1.1; the old runtime is 2.1.7; the offer and acknowledgment core is 2.1.13.

n: 2.8
name: bml-sources
kind: hub
is: The files the BML study cites: its own report, the companion papers and source samples of the 2000 system, the three 2026 BML readers and their lowering, the 2026 grammar engine, control cores, documents and fixtures of the old body, two private notes, and three files read to apply the critic's corrections.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/bml

n: 2.8.1
name: bml.md
